---
import NetEffect from '../components/NetEffect.astro';
import Space from '../components/Space.astro';
---
<html>
    <head>
        <meta charset="utf-8">
        <title>Luis的小站</title>
        <link rel="icon" href="/icon.ico" type="image/x-icon">
        <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/icon.ico" type="image/x-icon">
        <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/globle_font.css">
        <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/globle_button_style.css">
        <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/globle_SideBlock_style.css">
    </head>
    <body>
        <div><img title="作者老婆desu" src="/globle_wifu.png" style="position: fixed; right: -15%; top: 50px; height: 100%;"></div>
        <div id="MiddleBlank" style="position: fixed; left: 20%; right: 20%; top: 0%; bottom: 0%; background-color: rgba(240, 240, 240, 0.5);border: 1px; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); border-style: solid; backdrop-filter: blur(20px);"></div>

        <div class="SideBlock" style="height: 50px; top: 0%; box-shadow: 0px 2px 1px 0.5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); border-top-left-radius: 0%; border-top-right-radius: 0%; border-bottom: 2px;">
            <a title="原神, 启动!" href="https://www.yuanshen.com/" target="_blank"><img src="/globle_genshit.png" style="height: 50px;"></a>
        </div>
        <div style="left: 20%; right: 20%; position: absolute; top: 70px; height: auto;">
            <Space />
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center;">
                <h1 onchange="button_style_change()" style="font-size: 40; color: rgba(50, 50, 50, 1);">你好, 这里是 Luis 的小站!</h1>
            </div>
            <Space />
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center;">
                <p>现在这里没啥东西, 但是渐渐会多起来的!</p>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center;">
                <p>但是有色图看😋(又回来了! )(并没有)</p>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center;">
                <p>轻虐, 服务器带宽就那么点, 还没写限制😭</p>
            </div>
            <Space />
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center;">
                <form id="form_setu" action="/setu.html" method="GET">
                    <button disabled class="button" href="/setu.html" type="submit" style="vertical-align:middle"><span>点了也点不动</span></button>
                </form>
            </div>
            <Space />
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center;">
                <p>同时还有</p><p style="text-decoration: line-through;">最新开发的</p><p>博客系统! </p>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center;">
                <form id="form_blog" action="/blog.html" method="GET">
                    <button class="button" herf="/blog.html" type="submit" style="vertical-align:middle"><span>点这里</span></button>
                </form>
            </div>
            <Space />
            <Space />
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center;">
                <p>哥们从穿戴教务处整的爬虫, 没啥看的</p>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center;">
                <form id="form_blog" action="/JWCNews.html" method="GET">
                    <button class="button" herf="/JWCNews.html" type="submit" style="vertical-align:middle"><span>点这里 </span></button>
                </form>
            </div>
            <Space />
            <Space />
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center;">
                <p>NcmDecry</p>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center;">
                <p>别用，有大问题</p>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center;">
                <form id="form_blog" action="/NcmDecry.html" method="GET">
                    <button disabled class="button" herf="/NcmDecry.html" type="submit" style="vertical-align:middle"><span>点了也点不动 </span></button>
                </form>
            </div>
            <div style="height: 60px"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="SideBlock" id="ButtomBlock" style="height: 60px; bottom: -5px; box-shadow: 0px -2px 1px 0.5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); border-top: 2px; border-bottom-left-radius: 0%; border-bottom-right-radius: 0%;">
                <span id="time" style="left: 30px; position: fixed; bottom: 20px;">载入时间中...</span>
                <span id="MICP" class="a1" style="right: 200px; position: fixed; bottom: 20px; font-size: 12px"><a href="https://icp.gov.moe/?keyword=20260530" target="_blank">萌ICP备20260530号</a></span>
                <span id="ICP" class="a1" style="right: 30px; position: fixed; bottom: 20px; font-size: 12px"><a class="a1" href="https://beian.miit.gov.cn" target="_blank">粤ICP备2025471125号</a></span>
        </div>
            <script src="/globle_time_from_build.js"></script>
            <NetEffect />

    </body>
</html>
